{
  "$comment": [
    "Every WCAG 2.2 success criterion, by number and level.",
    "",
    "Source: https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/ (W3C Recommendation).",
    "",
    "This exists so a finding cannot cite a criterion that does not exist. An",
    "invented criterion number in an audit report is worse than none: it looks",
    "authoritative, it survives into a compliance document, and nobody catches",
    "it until an auditor does.",
    "",
    "Levels are A, AA or AAA. The four criteria removed in 2.2 (4.1.1 Parsing was",
    "obsoleted) are excluded, so citing one is caught as an error."
  ],
